Package: egcar
Type: Package
Title: Accelerated Sparse Generalized Correlation Analysis via
        Regression
Version: 0.2.18
Authors@R: c(person("EGCAR", "Contributors", role = "aut"),
    person("TannisthaM", role = "cre", email = "tannistha@uchicago.edu"),
    person("Claire", "Donnat", role = "cph",
    comment = "Bundled MIT-licensed initializer helpers"))
Description: Fits separate entrywise and global row-group sparse generalized
    correlation estimators using accelerated alternating direction updates,
    cached spectral reductions, and localized loading extraction. Includes
    direct-penalty cross-validation, rate-scaled fits, reusable common folds,
    and comparison wrappers for sparse generalized
    correlation analysis, regularized and sparse generalized canonical
    correlation analysis, and penalized multiset canonical correlation analysis.
    Sparse generalized correlation analysis can use its paper-based validation
    score or the common comparison score used by the other wrappers.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/TannisthaM/EGCAR
BugReports: https://github.com/TannisthaM/EGCAR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: Rcpp, RSpectra, callr, stats, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, RcppEigen
Suggests: future, future.apply, parallelly, RhpcBLASctl, RGCCA, PMA,
        ggplot2, remotes, testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2
SystemRequirements: C++14
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = FALSE)
